@model GisProjectViewModel
@using RealEstate.Domain.Enums
@inject RealEstate.Web.Services.UiPermissions Ui
@{ var p = Model.Project; ViewData["Title"] = "GIS - " + p.ProjectCode; await Ui.LoadAsync();
   string Badge(BoundaryStatus s) => s switch { BoundaryStatus.Verified => "text-bg-success", BoundaryStatus.Draft => "text-bg-warning", BoundaryStatus.Rejected => "text-bg-danger", _ => "text-bg-secondary" }; }
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2 mb-3">
    <div><h1 class="h3 mb-1">@p.ProjectCode - @p.ProjectName</h1><div class="text-muted">Boundaries, layers and survey documents</div></div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" asp-action="ExportGeoJson" asp-route-projectId="@p.Id">Export GeoJSON</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" asp-action="Index">Back to overview</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><span class="fw-semibold">Project boundary versions</span>
        @if (Ui.Has("gis.manage")) { <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" asp-action="SubmitBoundary" asp-route-projectId="@p.Id">Submit new survey</a> }</div>
    @if (Model.Boundaries.Count == 0) { <div class="card-body text-muted">No boundary has been submitted yet.</div> }
    else
    {
        <div class="table-responsive-md"><table class="table align-middle mb-0 table-stack">
            <thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Survey</th><th>Surveyed by</th><th>Geometry</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
            @foreach (var b in Model.Boundaries)
            {
                <tr><td data-label="Version">v@(b.VersionNo)</td><td data-label="Survey">@b.SurveyReference (@b.SurveyDate.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"))</td><td data-label="Surveyed by">@b.SurveyedBy</td>
                    <td data-label="Geometry">@b.GeometryType, @b.VertexCount points, @b.SrsCode</td><td data-label="Status"><span class="badge @Badge(b.Status)">@b.Status</span></td>
                    <td class="text-end"><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" asp-action="BoundaryDetails" asp-route-projectId="@p.Id" asp-route-id="@b.Id">Open</a></td></tr>
            }
            </tbody></table></div>
    }
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><span class="fw-semibold">Map layers</span>
        @if (Ui.Has("gis.manage")) { <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" asp-action="LayerForm" asp-route-projectId="@p.Id">New layer</a> }</div>
    @if (Model.Layers.Count == 0) { <div class="card-body text-muted">No layers defined yet.</div> }
    else
    {
        <div class="table-responsive-md"><table class="table align-middle mb-0 table-stack">
            <thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Name</th><th>Kind</th><th>System</th><th>Order</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
            @foreach (var l in Model.Layers)
            {
                <tr><td data-label="Code">@l.Code</td><td data-label="Name">@l.Name</td><td data-label="Kind">@l.Kind</td><td data-label="System">@l.SrsCode</td><td data-label="Order">@l.SortOrder</td>
                    <td data-label="Status"><span class="badge @(l.IsActive ? "text-bg-success" : "text-bg-secondary")">@(l.IsActive ? "Active" : "Inactive")</span></td>
                    <td class="text-end">@if (Ui.Has("gis.manage")) { <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" asp-action="LayerForm" asp-route-projectId="@p.Id" asp-route-id="@l.Id">Edit</a> }</td></tr>
            }
            </tbody></table></div>
    }
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-header fw-semibold">Survey and map documents</div>
    @if (Model.Documents.Count == 0) { <div class="card-body text-muted">No documents uploaded yet.</div> }
    else
    {
        <div class="table-responsive-md"><table class="table align-middle mb-0 table-stack">
            <thead><tr><th>Title</th><th>Type</th><th>Survey</th><th>System</th><th>Size</th><th>Uploaded</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
            @foreach (var d in Model.Documents)
            {
                <tr><td data-label="Title">@d.Title<div class="small text-muted">@d.FileName</div></td><td data-label="Type">@d.DocumentType</td><td data-label="Survey">@(d.SurveyReference ?? "-")</td><td data-label="System">@(d.SrsCode ?? "-")</td>
                    <td data-label="Size">@((d.SizeBytes / 1024.0).ToString("N0")) KB</td><td data-label="Uploaded">@d.CreatedAtUtc.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")</td>
                    <td class="text-end text-nowrap"><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" asp-action="DownloadDocument" asp-route-projectId="@p.Id" asp-route-documentId="@d.Id">Download</a>
                        @if (Ui.Has("gis.manage"))
                        {
                            <form asp-action="DeleteDocument" method="post" class="d-inline" onsubmit="var r = prompt('Reason for removing this document (at least 5 characters):'); if (!r) return false; this.reason.value = r; return true;">
                                <input type="hidden" name="projectId" value="@p.Id" /><input type="hidden" name="documentId" value="@d.Id" /><input type="hidden" name="reason" /><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" type="submit">Remove</button></form>
                        }</td></tr>
            }
            </tbody></table></div>
    }
    @if (Ui.Has("gis.manage"))
    {
        <div class="card-body border-top">
            <form asp-action="UploadDocument" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="row g-2" data-loading-form>
                <input type="hidden" name="projectId" value="@p.Id" />
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><label class="form-label" for="file">File</label><input type="file" class="form-control" id="file" name="file" required /></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-2"><label class="form-label" for="type">Type</label><select class="form-select" id="type" name="type">@foreach (var t in Enum.GetValues<MapDocumentType>()) { <option value="@t">@t</option> }</select></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><label class="form-label" for="srsId">Coordinate system</label><select class="form-select" id="srsId" name="srsId"><option value="">Not stated</option>@foreach (var s in Model.Systems) { <option value="@s.Id">@s.Code - @s.Name</option> }</select></div>
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-3"><label class="form-label" for="title">Title</label><input class="form-control" id="title" name="title" maxlength="200" /></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><label class="form-label" for="surveyReference">Survey reference</label><input class="form-control" id="surveyReference" name="surveyReference" maxlength="100" /></div>
                <div class="col-6 col-lg-3"><label class="form-label" for="surveyDate">Survey date</label><input type="date" class="form-control" id="surveyDate" name="surveyDate" /></div>
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-6"><label class="form-label" for="description">Description</label><input class="form-control" id="description" name="description" maxlength="1000" /></div>
                <div class="col-12"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"><span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm d-none me-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>Upload document</button>
                    <span class="text-muted small ms-2">Allowed file types follow the company document settings (add geojson, zip or dxf there for survey files).</span></div>
            </form>
        </div>
    }
</div>
